      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've found reproduction steps that trigger it every time!\n\n1 - Rejoin/join a world while your contact sender and receiver are within proximity\n\n2 - The receiver will not read the sender contact and remain blue\n\n3 - Either reload the avatar or extend your senders outside the receiver to fix it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
