      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems it has to do with the optimizations done to proximity contacts, I myself had issue with the new behavior. I don't know if it's intended or not but sometime my proximity contacts stops working and flickers to 0.00 it often happen when it was close to another player and it definitely didn't happen before the 2023.2.4 update.",
