  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-07-08T06:19:04.063Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Load into an avatar with self-only, proximity receivers and custom tags > Random chance of contact not functioning (remains blue in overlay). Refreshing the avatar fixes it but occurs randomly for each client. I've also noticed that it never happens to the same contact/set of contacts.\n\nHere are two screenshots, one before reloading the avatar and one after.\n\nhttps://imagebin.ca/v/7ScmwPcVWFOY\n\nhttps://imagebin.ca/v/7ScnGOV8rcGk\n\nNotice the contact on the right switching from blue to green without the contact sender position changing. There are 23 total contact components, although the issue still persisted with 6 total.",
